secubox-led-heartbeat (2.0.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * NEW: HealthBump 3-tier LED system
    - LED1 (bottom): Hardware layer - CPU, memory, WAN
    - LED2 (middle): Services layer - HAProxy, nginx, certs
    - LED3 (top): Security layer - CrowdSec bans, attack rate
  * NEW: Variable pulse speeds (slow/medium/fast per layer)
  * NEW: SPUNK ALERT - rapid all-red flash on critical failure
  * NEW: secubox-led CLI for manual control
  * NEW: secubox-led-trigger for kernel timer setup
  * NEW: secubox-healthbump.timer (30s health checks)
  * IMPROVED: I2C timing - 30ms delays, brightness 100
  * COMPAT: Legacy secubox-led-heartbeat daemon retained

 -- Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>  Thu, 08 May 2026 10:00:00 +0200

